M67: CDK app entrypoint dependency closure
Date: 2026-09-06. Local macOS and disposable Linux amd64 / Node 22 validation.

Reproduction
- Actual cdk.json app: npx ts-node --prefer-ts-exts bin/app.ts.
- Existing package.json and lockfile did not declare/install ts-node.
- In Node 22.23.2 container, network none, empty npm cache and no global ts-node:
  npm_config_offline=true npm run synth -- --no-lookups --quiet
  exited 1: npm ENOTCACHED fetching ts-node. See before.log.

Diagnosis and minimal fix
- Added only ts-node ^10.9.2 to src/stacks devDependencies and locked npm resolution.
- Same npm run synth now enters IncidentAgentStack and reaches Lambda bundling;
  Node-only container then lacks pip and Docker, so full packaging still fails.
- source-map-support/register import works: ts-node redirects it to its own
  @cspotcode/source-map-support. No separate source-map dependency or app change needed.
- Existing dependency versions and CDK app configuration unchanged.

Runtime regression
- tests/test_cdk_app_entrypoint.py executes cdk.json app in a temporary project.
- Copies actual main TypeScript stack, bin/app.ts, config and Step Functions JSON.
- PATH contains only node/npm/npx/sh; npm cache and home are new, npm offline=true.
- No inherited AWS/GitHub credentials, no global ts-node executable, no NODE_PATH.
- Uses actual CDK context plus aws:cdk:bundling-stacks=[] and a fake AWS account.
- Validates emitted assembly identity/environment and core AWS resource types.
- Before fix: 1 failed with same ENOTCACHED. After fix: 1 passed in 3.09s.
- Test harness initially omitted sh in restricted PATH; corrected the fixture, not production code.
- Bundling is disabled only for this app-entrypoint test. This is not proof that
  default npm run synth packages Lambda dependencies or that AWS deployment succeeds.

Installation
- Host npm ci: 26 packages added / 47 audited, known vulnerabilities 0.
- Removed copied scratch node_modules, then Linux npm ci from the final lockfile:
  exit 0, 26 packages added / 47 audited, known vulnerabilities 0.
- Direct configured app after dependency installation synthesized 98 resources offline.

Scope
- Original src/stacks/package.json + lockfile and one runtime regression changed.
- Existing mixed WIP preserved; no original commit/push, remote CI or AWS deployment.
- P5-E remote App/lab experiment still awaits reauthentication and scope confirmation.

